{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"checks\":[{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bca408c75cbf8467afafada6\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.fe130c0787c4e3c0c4c6ee00\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"In preparing invitations and advertisements to promote their services, intermediaries should ensure that they do not contain any misleading or deceptive information, and they must comply with paragraph 2.3 of the Code of Conduct.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The same distributor promotion may attract this additional advertising obligation. It qualifies the interpretation of a negative gift result, without adding an element to the gift predicate.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.08fe194938f2c11aa547bc59\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"which would in fact be derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The source of advertised returns directly informs this candidate's separation of underlying fund returns from distributor benefits. Advertising a return does not establish a gift.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.2a6321b4ce90763bf0be564e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.08fe194938f2c11aa547bc59\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"without any guaranteed rates of return\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"},{\"quote\":\"which would in fact be derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"These observations inform component identification and gift classification: prominently advertised returns can arise from funds without a distributor guarantee.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.6d6e7adc6faa9d94b74c08e5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.08fe194938f2c11aa547bc59\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"which would in fact be derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Return provenance bears on identifying the assessed benefit and supplying gift status. It does not itself establish that the benefit passes the gift control.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.968dbccb08282a4e8a580ae5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.08fe194938f2c11aa547bc59\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"without any guaranteed rates of return\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"},{\"quote\":\"which would in fact be derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The offer-level component inventory must distinguish marketed fund returns from additional benefits. Neither advertising returns nor lacking a guarantee resolves the existence of a non-discount gift.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.97af37a2579f59b0ee43211f\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.08fe194938f2c11aa547bc59\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"which would in fact be derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"This bears directly on the candidate's distinction between actual fund returns and separately classified incentive components.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.08fe194938f2c11aa547bc59\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"distributors offered or marketed the services described in paragraph 3 above\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"},{\"quote\":\"which would in fact be derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Marketing attribution and return provenance are distinct here, informing the candidate's offer-attribution inquiry. The passage does not establish that marketing fund returns constitutes offering a gift.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bca408c75cbf8467afafada6\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.08fe194938f2c11aa547bc59\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"which would in fact be derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u20.5257\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Return provenance informs the assumed component inventory and substantive classification underlying non_discount_gift_component.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.3277075c342c017778d29eeb\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The advertising rule shares the distributor and fund-promotion context and turns on return provenance, which also informs component identification. It supplies no gift-classification rule.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.2a6321b4ce90763bf0be564e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.3277075c342c017778d29eeb\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the advertisement, particularly the presentation of financial return relating to the services, should be prepared in a manner that is consistent with the principles under the SFC’s Advertising Guidelines Applicable to Collective Investment Schemes Authorized under the Product Codes4.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"An advertisement for the assessed offer can trigger this parallel obligation. This supports the candidate's limitation against treating the component result as approval of the combined offer.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.6d6e7adc6faa9d94b74c08e5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.3277075c342c017778d29eeb\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Shared actor, promotion and return provenance provide indirect relevance. A true result under this gift-only compliance control does not resolve the advertising obligation.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.968dbccb08282a4e8a580ae5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.3277075c342c017778d29eeb\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the advertisement, particularly the presentation of financial return relating to the services, should be prepared in a manner that is consistent with the principles under the SFC’s Advertising Guidelines Applicable to Collective Investment Schemes Authorized under the Product Codes4.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The selected promotional offer may also be advertised under this rule. This is a concrete additional control preserved by the candidate's limited result, not a condition of its gift prohibition.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.97af37a2579f59b0ee43211f\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.3277075c342c017778d29eeb\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The rule overlaps the candidate's fund-promotion scope and informs return-source assessment. Its advertising obligation remains separate from gift and discount classification.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.3277075c342c017778d29eeb\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Where a distributor highlights in an advertisement the financial return of its services, which is in fact derived from the actual return(s) of the underlying SFC-authorised fund(s)\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The passage distinguishes the distributor's advertising act from the underlying source of returns, relevant to attribution inquiries. It does not establish an offer of a gift or a third-party-funded benefit.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bca408c75cbf8467afafada6\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.3277075c342c017778d29eeb\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the advertisement, particularly the presentation of financial return relating to the services, should be prepared in a manner that is consistent with the principles under the SFC’s Advertising Guidelines Applicable to Collective Investment Schemes Authorized under the Product Codes4.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u21.5903\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The same promotional offer can carry an advertising obligation independently of whether its inventory contains a non-discount gift. Relevance is through overlapping scope and the result's limited effect.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.b30e166d48a33f93b8180ea3\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Specifically, the advertisements of these services should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Representations about guaranteed returns overlap the candidate's return-component inquiry and promotional context. Misleading presentation is a separate issue and does not establish gift status.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.2a6321b4ce90763bf0be564e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.b30e166d48a33f93b8180ea3\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The same advertised return arrangement may trigger both controls. The misleading-impression rule qualifies any inference of overall compliance from an excepted or non-gift component.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.6d6e7adc6faa9d94b74c08e5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.b30e166d48a33f93b8180ea3\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Specifically, the advertisements of these services should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"A benefit that satisfies this gift-only control can still be advertised misleadingly. Shared promotion scope makes this relevant to the candidate's narrowly defined compliance result.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.968dbccb08282a4e8a580ae5\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.b30e166d48a33f93b8180ea3\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Specifically, the advertisements of these services should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"This is an additional restriction potentially applicable to the selected offer's advertising. It supports the limited effect of a false gift predicate but supplies no discount exception or gift test.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.97af37a2579f59b0ee43211f\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.b30e166d48a33f93b8180ea3\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Return representations share the candidate's promotional setting and may concern the assessed component. Misleading advertising and substantive gift classification remain distinct inquiries.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bc55be7e973a689d07f9e64b\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.b30e166d48a33f93b8180ea3\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Specifically, the advertisements of these services should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"any guaranteed returns provided by distributors may create a misleading impression that these returns are provided by the underlying fund(s).\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u10.2239\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The source expressly identifies misleading return attribution, relevant to distinguishing the offeror from the source of performance. Neither passage determines third-party gift attribution.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.bca408c75cbf8467afafada6\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.b30e166d48a33f93b8180ea3\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"Specifically, the advertisements of these services should avoid giving a misleading impression that the relevant services or underlying fund(s) would generate positive or guaranteed returns without any risk of loss.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The offer-level gift result leaves this potentially overlapping advertising restriction unresolved. The connection is shared promotional scope, not entailment of a gift classification.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.5c3ed4ed6cebe4e2b8cca4f7\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the advertisements should not draw a parallel between the services and the placement of cash on deposits\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"These SFC-authorised funds and services were often promoted by the distributors to the public through aggressive and high-profile marketing campaigns.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u4.1115\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"The source connects service advertising and fund promotion, so a component's promotion can also face this restriction. Deposit comparisons neither establish gift status nor alter the discount exception.\"},{\"candidate_id\":\"node.2a6321b4ce90763bf0be564e\",\"claim_id\":\"claim.5c3ed4ed6cebe4e2b8cca4f7\",\"evidence\":[{\"quote\":\"the advertisements should not draw a parallel between the services and the placement of cash on deposits\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u22.6374\"},{\"quote\":\"These SFC-authorised funds and services were often promoted by the distributors to the public through aggressive and high-profile marketing campaigns.\",\"unit_id\":\"db43e253bea18.u4.1115\"}],\"judgment\":\"RELEVANCE_FOUND\",\"rationale\":\"Shared distributor campaigns provide indirect relevance and an independent reason a combined offer may remain noncompliant despite its gift result. The advertising prohibition is not an additional gift-predicate element.\"}],\"missed_qualifications\":[\"The retained packet supplies the paragraph 3 service context in db43e253bea18.u3.792: “distributors asked clients to provide a mandate or standing instruction to invest in one or more SFC-authorised funds under specific circumstances”. Claims treating that context as wholly missing should be qualified.\",\"Footnote 4 is supplied in db43e253bea18.u30.8235: “As supplemented by the frequently asked questions and other guidance issued by the SFC from time to time.” The Guidelines and supplementary guidance themselves remain unavailable.\",\"Shared promotional scope establishes indirect relevance, not incorporation of advertising requirements into paragraph 3.11 or proof that every assessed offer triggers those requirements.\",\"The observed fund-derived returns inform component identification but do not categorically establish gift status or its absence; the source's “may be considered a gift” qualification remains necessary.\",\"Offering attribution should remain distinct from funding or fulfilment. The advertising passages do not resolve whether a distributor offers a particular benefit merely by describing it.\"]}"}}
